    "Include sessions created by the Copilot CLI in the sidebar. Choose how far back to surface them, or turn this off to hide CLI-created sessions entirely.": "在侧边栏中显示由 Copilot CLI 创建的会话。你可以选择显示多长时间内的会话，或关闭此功能以完全隐藏 CLI 会话。",
    "Automatically archive and delete sessions linked to merged pull requests after they've been inactive. Deleting a session also deletes its workflow runs and can't be undone.": "关联的拉取请求合并后，自动归档并删除长期不活跃的会话。删除会话也会删除其工作流运行记录，且无法撤销。",
    "Move inactive sessions to archive after their pull request has been merged.": "拉取请求合并后，将不活跃的会话移入归档。",
