    "Adjust how conversation content behaves with screen readers.": "调整对话内容在屏幕阅读器中的行为。",
    "Stabilize transcript for screen readers": "为屏幕阅读器稳定对话记录",
    "Turn this on if your screen reader jumps to new content while a response streams. It keeps earlier messages stable and can use more memory in long conversations.": "如果屏幕阅读器在流式响应时跳到新内容，请启用此项。它会保持较早消息稳定，但长对话可能占用更多内存。",
    "Customization moved to the sidebar": "自定义功能已移至侧边栏",
    "Manage Copilot integrations and extensions from Customize.": "请从“自定义”管理 Copilot 集成和扩展。",
    "Go to Customize": "转到自定义",
    "From your GitHub Copilot subscription.": "来自你的 GitHub Copilot 订阅。",
    "Board view": "看板视图",
    "Add a board layout to My Work that groups the current view's issues and pull requests into Backlog, Active, Needs attention, and Done columns derived from their state and linked session activity.": "在“我的工作”中添加看板布局，根据状态和关联会话活动，将当前议题和拉取请求分为待办、进行中、需要关注和已完成。",
    "Sidebar configuration menu": "侧边栏配置菜单",
    "Replace the sidebar's group-by menu with a configuration menu offering independent grouping and ordering, Status/PR/Environment/Source filters, Collapse all, and Mark all as read.": "将侧边栏的分组菜单替换为配置菜单，提供独立的分组与排序、状态/PR/环境/来源筛选、全部折叠和全部标记为已读。",
    "Tail-first session load": "优先加载会话末尾",
    "Speed up opening a large session by rendering the most recent messages first, then streaming older history in the background instead of blocking on the whole transcript.": "先呈现最新消息，再在后台流式加载较早记录，从而加快大型会话的打开速度。",
    "Editable file tabs": "可编辑文件选项卡",
    "Open local code files in file tabs with an editable editor instead of the read-only line viewer.": "在可编辑的文件选项卡中打开本地代码文件，而不是使用只读行查看器。",
    "Cloud sessions": "云端会话",
    "Run sessions in a cloud sandbox.": "在云端沙盒中运行会话。",
    "Assisted approvals": "辅助批准",
    "Enable Assisted mode, which approves requests an LLM safety check deems safe and prompts otherwise. When you turn off this experiment, existing Assisted sessions change to Ask every time (Off). Agent Merge sessions change to Approve all.": "启用辅助模式：经 LLM 安全检查判定安全的请求会自动批准，其他请求仍会提示。关闭此实验后，现有辅助会话将改为每次询问，代理合并会话将改为全部批准。",
    "Tool permissions in the composer": "输入框中的工具权限",
    "Set Tool permissions from the composer's mode picker instead of the /permissions slash command. Selecting a mode also becomes the default for new sessions.": "从输入框的模式选择器设置工具权限，无需使用 /permissions 命令。所选模式也会成为新会话的默认值。",
    "Queued message controls": "排队消息控制",
    "Manage queued timeline items: edit messages, discard items, and choose which message runs next. Available for local sessions only while in development.": "管理时间线中排队的项目：编辑消息、丢弃项目并选择下一条要运行的消息。开发期间仅适用于本地会话。",
    "WSL hosts (Preview)": "WSL 主机（预览）",
    "Connect to and create sessions inside WSL.": "连接到 WSL 并在其中创建会话。",
    "Rubber-duck agent": "橡皮鸭代理",
    "Enable the rubber-duck subagent for constructive feedback on code and designs (Claude and GPT models only). Adds the /rubber-duck slash command to the composer. Restart the app after toggling.": "启用橡皮鸭子代理，为代码和设计提供建设性反馈（仅限 Claude 和 GPT 模型）。这会在输入框中添加 /rubber-duck 命令；切换后请重启应用。",
    "Background agents and shell tasks": "后台代理和 Shell 任务",
    "Show and manage background agents and shell tasks from one Background pill in Sessions. Group work as Running, Idle, or Completed; inspect shell details; stop or cancel active work; and clear completed work.": "在会话的“后台”入口中统一查看和管理后台代理与 Shell 任务。可按运行中、空闲或已完成分组，查看 Shell 详情，停止或取消活动任务，并清理已完成任务。",
    "Voice dictation": "语音听写",
    "Record speech with a shortcut and transcribe it locally into the composer.": "使用快捷键录制语音，并在本地转写到输入框。",
    "Use bundled git": "使用内置 Git",
    "Use the git binary shipped with the app instead of the system-installed one. Falls back to your system git when off.": "使用应用自带的 Git，而不是系统安装的 Git。关闭时使用系统 Git。",
    "WebSocket terminal transport": "WebSocket 终端传输",
    "Carry the embedded terminal's PTY traffic over the app's WebSocket instead of Tauri IPC. Restart the app after toggling.": "通过应用的 WebSocket 传输内嵌终端的 PTY 流量，而不是使用 Tauri IPC。切换后请重启应用。",
    "Companion device integration": "配套设备集成",
    "Connect supported companion devices to navigate sessions, use voice input, and control integrations.": "连接支持的配套设备，以浏览会话、使用语音输入并控制集成。",
    "Impeccable design skill": "Impeccable 设计技能",
    "Adds /impeccable, a frontend design and UI-craft skill by Paul Bakaus (impeccable.style), bundled under Apache-2.0. Its optional automation scripts need Node 18+ on your PATH; without Node the agent falls back to the design guidance alone.": "添加由 Paul Bakaus（impeccable.style）制作的前端设计与 UI 打磨技能 /impeccable，以 Apache-2.0 许可内置。可选自动化脚本要求 PATH 中存在 Node 18+；没有 Node 时，代理仅使用设计指南。",
    "Full view for details": "详情全宽视图",
    "Open pull requests and issues in a full-width view instead of the side panel.": "在全宽视图中打开拉取请求和议题，而不是使用侧面板。",
    "Rich composer": "富文本输入框",
    "Use the Lexical-based rich-text editor for prompts, PR and issue comments, and issue creation.": "使用基于 Lexical 的富文本编辑器编写提示词、PR 和议题评论，以及创建议题。",
    "Browser screenshot annotations": "浏览器截图标注",
    "Annotate frozen browser screenshots with arrows, shapes, and comments.": "使用箭头、形状和评论标注冻结的浏览器截图。",
    "Connected": "已连接",
    "Testing connection, GitHub Copilot": "正在测试连接，GitHub Copilot"
